# Airline evaluator API

This file is the evaluator-facing contract. The required scope and output below
are fixed; add factual inputs, internal variables, and policy subscopes without
renaming or removing them.

- Requirement ID `AIRLINE-TOTAL-COST`: scope `TotalCost`, output `total_cost`.

> Module Api
> Using Definitions as W
> Using Section1NonTextual as S1

```catala-metadata
declaration scope TotalCost:
  input itinerary content W.Itinerary
  policy scope S1.Trip
  output total_cost content money
```

```catala
scope TotalCost:
  definition policy.itinerary equals itinerary
  definition total_cost equals policy.total_cost
```
